<section class="section faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="grid">
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="faq__title t-h2">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq__list">
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">When and where is the Forum?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">13–14 March 2027 in San Francisco. We're confirming the venue now and will announce it here and on Luma.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">Who should come?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">Funders and philanthropic institutions, researchers and governance designers, people working on policy and public infrastructure, and founders. The program is built for people who want to help work out what the AI age should fund and who decides.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">How do I apply to speak?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">Applications are open and reviewed as they arrive. There is no deadline yet; when one is set it will appear here first. <a class="faq__link" data-url="applyToSpeak" href="#">Apply to speak</a>.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">What do tickets include, and what do they cost?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a"><a class="faq__link" data-url="tickets" href="#">Luma</a> lists the current tickets and passes, with prices and what each includes. The Patron pass comes with a seat at the private dinner on the eve of the Forum.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">Are sessions recorded?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">Main-stage talks are recorded and published on our YouTube channel. Workshops, sessions under the Chatham House Rule, and the dinner are not. Our media team also records interviews with community members across both days, and you can book one on site.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">Can I bring my child?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">Yes. People do every year.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">Do you provide travel support or visa letters?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">We don't usually offer travel support, but once you have a ticket we're happy to send a visa invitation letter. Just write to us.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">How can my organization partner with the Forum?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">Our <a class="faq__link" data-url="partnerOnEvent" href="#">partner page</a> sets out the options. You can also write to us at <a class="faq__link" href="mailto:contact@fundingthecommons.io">contact@fundingthecommons.io</a>.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary class="faq__q t-label">Any other questions?</summary>
          <p class="faq__a">We'd love to hear from you at <a class="faq__link" href="mailto:contact@fundingthecommons.io">contact@fundingthecommons.io</a>.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

